| #  | Function             | Syntax                   | Kaam                               |
| -- | -------------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |
| 1  | `os.getcwd()`        | `os.getcwd()`            | Current working directory ka path  |
| 2  | `os.listdir()`       | `os.listdir(path)`       | Files/folders ki list              |
| 3  | `os.chdir()`         | `os.chdir(path)`         | Working directory change           |
| 4  | `os.mkdir()`         | `os.mkdir("folder")`     | **Ek** naya folder banana          |
| 5  | `os.makedirs()`      | `os.makedirs("a/b/c")`   | **Nested folders** banana          |
| 6  | `os.rmdir()`         | `os.rmdir("folder")`     | **Empty folder** delete            |
| 7  | `os.remove()`        | `os.remove("file")`      | File delete                        |
| 8  | `os.rename()`        | `os.rename("old","new")` | File/folder ka naam change         |
| 9  | `os.path.exists()`   | `os.path.exists(path)`   | Path exist karta hai ya nahi       |
| 10 | `os.path.isfile()`   | `os.path.isfile(path)`   | Path **file** hai ya nahi          |
| 11 | `os.path.isdir()`    | `os.path.isdir(path)`    | Path **folder** hai ya nahi        |
| 12 | `os.path.join()`     | `os.path.join(a,b)`      | Paths ko safely join karna         |
| 13 | `os.path.basename()` | `os.path.basename(path)` | Path ka **last name**              |
| 14 | `os.path.dirname()`  | `os.path.dirname(path)`  | Directory ka path                  |
| 15 | `os.path.abspath()`  | `os.path.abspath(path)`  | Absolute/complete path             |
| 16 | `os.path.getsize()`  | `os.path.getsize(file)`  | File size **bytes** mein           |
| 17 | `os.environ`         | `os.environ["NAME"]`     | Environment variable access        |
| 18 | `os.environ.get()`   | `os.environ.get("NAME")` | Environment variable safely access |
| 19 | `os.walk()`          | `os.walk(path)`          | Folder की पूरी hierarchy traverse  |


सबसे जरूरी differences


os.mkdir()                 → एक folder
os.makedirs()              → nested folders

os.rmdir()                 → empty folder delete
os.remove()                → file delete

os.path.exists()          → मौजूद है?
os.path.isfile()          → file है?
os.path.isdir()           → folder है?

basename()                → आखिरी नाम
dirname()                 → directory path

join()                   → paths जोड़ना
abspath()                → complete path
getsize()                → file size






